n: the April drop of 6.8 billion could mark continued post-enrollment or administrative-payment weakness, but January through February were nearly flat and this BEA component has enough smoothing that a further large May drop is less likely than a modest decline."},{"kind":"forecast","point":1037.5,"ciLow":1018.0,"ciHigh":1056.0}]}
