pril payroll weakness is revised away and survey volatility holds unemployment near 4.8 or 4.9. Outside-the-interval scenarios require either a sharp labour-market break above 5.5 or a strong participation/employment surprise below 4.7.\"},{\"kind\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Review disposition: accepted the resolver critique by making the August 2026 ONS release placeholder the explicit date source, accepted the model-prior critique by naming the persistence/recent-mean prior, and accepted the optional unit-label clarification for historical context.\"},{\"kind\":\"forecast\",\"point\":5.1,\"ciLow\":4.7,\"ciHigh\":5.5}]}"}}
